{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32224","headline":"送陈嘏之侯官兼简李常侍 · 温庭筠","name":"送陈嘏之侯官兼简李常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纵得步兵无绿蚁，不缘句漏有丹砂。\n殷勤爲报同袍友，我亦无心似海槎。\n春服照尘连草色，夜船闻雨滴芦花。\n梅仙自是青云客，莫羡相如却到家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}